        "text": "Jennifer Butt",
        "text_sha256": "512f624660ab92009be70497d0577e7e4df701e19b036055f17dc0706693e300",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Jennifer Butt, M.D., F.A.C.O.G.",
        "text_sha256": "3fd0d1fee31dc191f5eb6735b4a4f752a64757c425dadf26356f04284eb77477",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Jennifer Butt, M.D., F.A.C.O.G.",
        "text_sha256": "c99456a830365d574fc1e89ba04912a7242a1f4b2b3e4be665a4a7b44936b2b6",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Jennifer Butt is a board-certified OB/GYN practicing in New York City.",
        "text_sha256": "ea0267ab9c33b9f3887c76b988e92f0414aed8a076079ac7408be6d9d4ee8533",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Butt was part of the B.A./M.D. program at Rutgers University in New Brunswick, New Jersey— receiving her B.A. in Biological Studies and M.D. from the Rutgers Robert Wood Johnson Medical School. She completed her residency in obstetrics and gynecology at Robert Wood Johnson University Hospital.",
        "text_sha256": "c2f940f508547cf0d63c1cdb900b07f9ddb6e6b51c28b0046ff7253d0cad91fb",
        "word_count": 46
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "She currently sees patients at her own private practice, Upper East Side OB/GYN, located in Manhattan.",
        "text_sha256": "63329efa772534dbb9321f54f5bd4a7abb5567b18d4c5158af74bc97c6eaf34c",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Board certification",
        "text_sha256": "c3898f54dc45eb740908fba4888cacdc613965ed71dc29f52a44926a33570aae",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Butt is board-certified with the American Board of Obstetrics and Gynecology, and is a Fellow of the American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists.",
        "text_sha256": "a3ef022cf94598cf77e2067e1ea556b219624a71b123bef8d39674b7a5257f0e",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Hospital affiliations",
        "text_sha256": "e6504e68d7e8e6b8187bc1b13e33b31f751fb7b365b27cf9f90691053f642ba2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Butt is affiliated with Lenox Hill Hospital in New York City.",
        "text_sha256": "694306046f3c048f4d9ddcc5d33739ab47a56df36a4263152b5e2614ea562f38",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Inspired to start her own business and deliver top-quality personalized care to her patients, Dr. Butt founded the practice Upper East Side OB/GYN in 2018.",
        "text_sha256": "5565a5b92b9721855445c35e2765185ed21b1c2d4d4f90fcc3d80a1607a7605d",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "She lives with her husband and son in downtown Manhattan.",
        "text_sha256": "343d152b46af67174c0d619834c0b32e518dc3546025df7e59a0877e035944b2",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Opens a new window",
        "text_sha256": "52b71e1a64c4aa4703a246e34de17b242088e4863ab032b365c12e07d7964633",
        "word_count": 4
      }
    ],
